      "text": [
        ": سَأَلْتُهُ عَنِ اَلْمَرْأَةِ تَضَعُ أَ يَحِلُّ أَنْ تَتَزَوَّجَ قَبْلَ أَنْ تَطْهُرَ قَالَ \"نَعَمْ وَ لَيْسَ لِزَوْجِهَا أَنْ يَدْخُلَ بِهَا حَتَّى تَطْهُرَ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4445 - Ibn Abi Umair narrated from Abdullah ibn Sinan, who narrated from Abu Abdullah (as): I asked him about a woman who gives birth, does it become permissible for her to marry before she purifies (from postnatal bleeding)?\nImam (as) replied: \"Yes, it is permissible. However, her husband must not consummate the marriage with her until she purifies.\""
        ]
      }
